            "name": "Create new Client-Debtor Relationship",
            "description": {
              "content": "You can create a debtor relationship by linking to an existing approved company in our system (preferred) by passing the company_id found using the GET/companies endpoint. Alternatively, you can create a new company and client-debtor relationship simultaneously by sending the company attributes. Note that all credit requests are reviewed by our operations team for approval.",
